OL,3,ATennessee halts executions after death
OL,4,Arow inmate Christa Pike survives hers
OL,5,
OL,6,FExecutions in Tennessee have been
OL,7,Fhalted for the rest of the year,
OL,8,FGovernor Bill Lee has said, after two
OL,9,Fattempts to execute death row inmate
OL,10,FChrista Pike by lethal injection
OL,11,Ffailed.
OL,13,FIn a statement to CBS News, the BBC's
OL,14,FUS partner, Lee said lawful executions
OL,15,Fwere among the state's "most serious
OL,16,Fresponsibilities", adding that he has
OL,17,Fordered a third-party review "to
OL,18,Fdetermine exactly what occurred".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
