OL,3,ATennessee halts executions after death
OL,4,Arow inmate Christa Pike survives hers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTennessee prison officials on Wednesday
OL,7,Fattempted to administer two lethal
OL,8,Fdoses of pentobarbital to Pike but she
OL,9,Fsurvived and was taken to hospital. Her
OL,10,Fmedical condition is unclear.
OL,12,FPike, 50 was sentenced to death in 1996
OL,13,Ffor the murder of Colleen Slemmer.
